<view class="page notification-page">
  <view class="binding-card card {{binding.bound > 0 ? 'bound' : ''}}">
    <view class="binding-head">
      <view>
        <view class="account-name">山月跨境</view>
        <view class="account-type">微信认证服务号</view>
      </view>
      <view class="binding-state">{{binding.bound > 0 ? '已绑定' : '待绑定'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{binding.bound > 0}}" class="binding-message">当前微信已与 ERP 账号匹配，公众号可按下方设置接收提醒。</view>
    <view wx:else class="binding-message">点击下方按钮可直接打开“山月跨境”。关注后返回本页，系统会识别当前微信，并只绑定到当前登录的 ERP 账号。</view>
    <view class="binding-actions">
      <button wx:if="{{binding.bound === 0}}" class="official-button" size="mini" bindtap="openOfficialAccount">打开山月跨境公众号</button>
      <button class="refresh-button" size="mini" loading="{{detecting}}" disabled="{{detecting}}" bindtap="detectAndBind">{{binding.bound > 0 ? '重新检测绑定' : '我已关注，检测并绑定'}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">提醒设置</view>
  <view class="settings card">
    <view class="setting-row main-setting">
      <view><view class="setting-title">公众号提醒总开关</view><view class="setting-desc">关闭后不再发送以下业务提醒</view></view>
      <switch checked="{{preferences.enabled}}" data-key="enabled" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#16a66a" />
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><view class="setting-title">新订单</view><view class="setting-desc">新订单同步到服务器后提醒</view></view><switch checked="{{preferences.newOrder}}" data-key="newOrder" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#1677ff" /></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><view class="setting-title">订单取消</view><view class="setting-desc">订单状态确认取消时提醒</view></view><switch checked="{{preferences.cancelled}}" data-key="cancelled" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#1677ff" /></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><view class="setting-title">即将延误</view><view class="setting-desc">仅待发货订单进入截止前 24 小时时提醒</view></view><switch checked="{{preferences.deadline}}" data-key="deadline" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#1677ff" /></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><view class="setting-title">订单退款</view><view class="setting-desc">官方退款金额增加时提醒</view></view><switch checked="{{preferences.refund}}" data-key="refund" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#1677ff" /></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><view class="setting-title">订单咨询</view><view class="setting-desc">收到新的买家售前咨询时提醒</view></view><switch checked="{{preferences.buyerInquiry}}" data-key="buyerInquiry" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#1677ff" /></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><view class="setting-title">售后消息</view><view class="setting-desc">收到申诉或售后待回复消息时提醒</view></view><switch checked="{{preferences.afterSales}}" data-key="afterSales" bindchange="onSwitch" color="#1677ff" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="privacy-note">提醒只发送给当前 ERP 账号匹配的公众号关注者，不会跨用户或跨店铺发送。微信可能依据平台规则限制发送频率。</view>
</view>
